in a breathtaking ink-wash universe where mountains bleed into clouds and cranes dance like calligraphy strokes:\n\nCliff of Whispering Winds\nGrip your way up ever-changing rockfaces using VR motion controls, where crumbling ink-stone holds force strategic leaps.\n\nHammer & Vermin\nWield a giant (zh\u00f9ti\u011b, cast iron) hammer to smash mischievous ink-rats bursting from rice paper screens.    \n\nSongbird Sanctuary\nLoad a bamboo slingshot to shoot clay pellets at phantom sparrows terrorizing a Zen garden.\n\nSecrets in the Scroll\nDiscover two (j\u012bgu\u0101n, mechanical puzzles) to unlock:\n\n\nLet's party !\nHost 2-16 player sessions where avatars in flowing Hanfu :\nCompete in leaderboard challenges (e.g., \"Most rats smashed in 60 seconds\")\n\n\nAdaptive grip mechanics for immersive weapon handling\n\nSpatial audio reacts to environment (e.g., climbing winds intensify with height)\n\nFuture Horizons\nLaunching with 3 core stages + 2 secret realms, with quarterly updates adding:\n\nNew\u673a\u5173 puzzles (tea ceremony balance challenge confirmed)\n\nSeasonal variants (snowy mountain climb, cherry blossom slingshot arena)\n\nExpanded avatar customization using historic Chinese dyes\n\nWhy Players Love It\n\"Finally, a VR party game where beauty and chaos share the same brushstroke.\"\n\u2013 Beta tester review", "short_description": "ZenInkParty: VR Adventures in a Living Scroll\nUnsheathe your controllers\u2014an ancient (shu\u01d0m\u00f2) world awaits your touch.\n\nLet's party !\nHost 2-16 player sessions where avatars in flowing Hanfu :\nCompete in leaderboard challenges"}]}, "developer_name": "LeoPardVR Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/LEOsangMO/-ZenInkPartyPrivacyPolicy/blob/main/ZenInkParty%20Policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "LeoPardVR Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.zeninkparty.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfor